---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Project Stories | Brainard's Greenscapes Las Cruces"
description: "Real Brainard's Greenscapes jobs from start to finish — hazard tree removal, drainage and erosion control, xeriscaping, and more, in our own crew's photos."
---

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="bg-green-950 text-white py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-green-300 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Project Stories</p>
    <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4">Real Jobs, Start to Finish</h1>
    <p class="text-green-100 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every project here is a real Brainard's Greenscapes job in Las Cruces, told in our crew's own photos — from the first cut to the final walkthrough.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Project cards -->
<section class="py-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {% for story in projectStories %}
      <a href="/projects/{{ story.slug }}/" class="group block bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100">
        {% set heroStep = story.steps[0] %}
        {% if heroStep.type == "video" %}
        {% image "src/assets/images/" + heroStep.poster, story.title, "w-full h-56 object-cover" %}
        {% else %}
        {% image "src/assets/images/" + heroStep.src, story.title, "w-full h-56 object-cover" %}
        {% endif %}
        <div class="p-6">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-green-700/90 text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full capitalize mb-3">{{ story.category }}</span>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 group-hover:text-green-700 transition-colors">{{ story.title }}</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">{{ story.location }}</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3">{{ story.summary }}</p>
          <span class="text-green-700 text-sm font-semibold">Read the full story &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/banner.njk" %}
